{"id":17794,"title":"90 | Hystrix 主要概念","content":"Hystrix 核心概念涵盖命令封装、降级策略及高级优化机制。HystrixCommand 基于命令模式，通过继承该类并将业务逻辑封装于 run 方法，实现对调用的容错保护。\n\n降级策略包含五种模式：快速失败（Fail Fast）直接在运行期抛出异常，适用于无需复杂处理的场景；静默失败（Fail Silent）返回空值或空列表；静态回退（Static Fallback）返回预设缺省值；网络回退（Fallback via Network）在主服务故障时调用辅助网络服务；主备切换（Primary/Secondary）通过开关控制新旧功能路由，常用于新功能灰度验证。\n\n针对高并发场景，Hystrix 提供两项高级特性。请求合并利用时间窗口将高频小请求批量打包，统一发送至后端再拆解响应，显著降低依赖服务压力。请求缓存基于线程局部变量，对相同 Key 的读请求复用缓存结果，避免重复访问后端，特别适用于分类列表等低频变动数据，同时支持主动刷新机制。掌握这些概念有助于构建高可用的分布式系统架构。","comments":[{"had_liked":false,"id":34247,"user_name":"Sam_Deep_Thinking","can_delete":false,"product_type":"c3","uid":1001152,"ip_address":"","ucode":"8E4EF6F24B821B","user_header":"https://static001.geekbang.org/account/avatar/00/0f/46/c0/106d98e7.jpg","comment_is_top":false,"comment_ctime":1540047541,"is_pvip":false,"replies":[{"id":12660,"content":"谢谢支持🌹","user_name":"作者回复","user_name_real":"杨波","uid":1030344,"ctime":1540732835,"ip_address":"","comment_id":34247,"utype":1}],"discussion_count":1,"race_medal":0,"score":2,"product_id":100007001,"comment_content":"多谢杨老师","like_count":3,"discussions":[{"author":{"id":1030344,"avatar":"https://static001.geekbang.org/account/avatar/00/0f/b8/c8/c94d38a7.jpg","nickname":"杨波","note":"","ucode":"FA3418BB703BCA","race_medal":0,"user_type":2,"is_pvip":false},"reply_author":{"id":0,"avatar":"","nickname":"","note":"","ucode":"","race_medal":0,"user_type":1,"is_pvip":false},"discussion":{"id":427155,"discussion_content":"谢谢支持🌹","content_length":5,"likes_number":0,"is_delete":false,"is_hidden":false,"ctime":1540732835,"is_liked":false,"can_delete":false,"is_complain":false,"is_top":true,"parent_id":0,"ip_address":"","group_id":0,"attachments":[]},"score":2,"extra":"{\"reply\":true,\"user_type\":2}","child_discussion_number":0,"child_discussions":[]}]},{"had_liked":false,"id":180478,"user_name":"zhaoni","can_delete":false,"product_type":"c3","uid":1052158,"ip_address":"","ucode":"F317ECD6380984","user_header":"http://thirdwx.qlogo.cn/